;	000000000300083877	;"Take 1 teaspoon by mouth 1 to 3 times daily or as directed by your health professional. May be taken directly by mouth or mixed into water or juice (grapefruit is best). Take on an empty stomach, at least 10 minutes before meals. Store at room temparature. Do not take when pregnant or breastfeeding. It is advisable to monitor liver function enzymes during usage."
