;	000000000300082099	;"As a dietary supplement for persons under 200lbs or 89kg in body weight use 1 AVEMAR packet daily. For persons over 200lbs or 89kg in body weight use 2 AVEMAR packets daily. Add AVEMAR packet to 4oz of water and drink immediately. AVEMAR can be mixed with other beverages, but only those providing less than 5mg of vitamin C per 4oz serving. To maximize absorption, consume AVEMAR one hour before or after a meal, and 2 hours before or after taking any drugs or other dietary supplements."
;	000000000300082098	;"As a dietry supplement for persons under 200lbs or 89kg in body weight use 1 AVEMAR packet daily. For persons over 200lbs or 89kg in body weight use 2 AVEMAR packets daily. Add AVEMAR packet to 4oz of water and drink immediately. AVEMAR can be mixed with other beverages, but only those providing less than 5mg of vitamin C per 4oz serving. To maximize absorption, consume AVE MAR one hour before or after a meal, and 2 hours before or after taking any drugs or other dieta,y supplements."
