;	000000000300088730	;"Dilute prior to ingestion. As a dietary supplement, ½ teaspoon diluted in eight ounces of your favorite beverage, two or three times daily, or as directed by a healthcare practitioner."
;	000000000300106002	;"Mix 1 scoop (3 g) with 2-8 oz of water daily. Due to the calming effects of magnesium, we recommend taking it 30-60 minutes before bedtime. Additional servings may be taken if desired, but excessive magnesium intake may cause a laxative effect. Minor crystallization may occur, but this does not affect product quality."
;	000000000300095948	;"<b>Children ages 4 to 12:</b> chew 1 gummy per day. <b>Ages 13 and older:</b> chew 1 gummy up to 4 times daily alone or at mealtime. Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight. Gummies may stick together in warmer climates, but this does not affect the potency, quality, or efficacy of the product. <b>For best results:</b> Spread serving size into multiple servings throughout the day. Taking too much magnesium at once may cause an undesired laxative effect. If this occurs, simply reduce number of gummies per serving."
