;	000000000300098327	;"Take 1 capsule, 4 to 6 times throughout the day or as recommended by your healthcare practitioner. <br> Discuss product use with a healthcare practitioner. Any ingested food has the potential for an allergic reaction. Discontinue use if side effects appear. <br> Sealed for your protection. <br> Not for use during pregnancy. <br> Keep out of reach of children."
;	000000000300098328	;"Take 1 capsule, 4 to 6 times throughout the day or as recommended by your healthcare practitioner. <br> Discuss product use with a healthcare practitioner. Any ingested food has the potential for an allergic reaction. Discontinue use if side effects appear. <br> Sealed for your protection. <br> Not for use during pregnancy. <br> Keep out of reach of children,"
