;	000000000300090417	;"Adults take 1 softgel 1-3 times a day with a meal or as directed by your qualified healthcare professional. Phosphatidylserine (PS) is a natural phospholipid that is a structural component of cell membranes.* It is an important phospholipid present in the brain and supports brain health.* Jarrow Formulas® PS100, featuring Sharp-PS®, utilizes a concentrated form of phosphatidylserine from sunflower lecithin (soy-free) that offers excellent stability.*"
;	000000000300096574	;"Adults and Children over 12 years: 1-2 Serving per day. Best taken before or between meals."
;	000000000300093224	;"Blend 1 tsp into a smoothie or mix 1 tsp with at least 10oz of water or juice. Stir and drink immediately. Mixture will thicken - increase liquid to achieve desired consistency, For best results, drink an additional glass of water after taking to ensure h dration."
;	000000000300100282	;"Take 1 serving by mouth. Hold in mouth for 30 - 90 seconds before swallowing. Repeat to desired dosage or as directed by a healthcare professional. Best taken on an empty stomach at least 10 minutes before meals. If pregnant or breastfeeding, consult your healthcare practitioner before use."
;	000000000300088667	;"<p><b>Ultra Binder:</b> Mix 1 stick pack into 8 ounces of water once daily or as directed by healthcare professional. Take 30 minutes before or 2 hours after meals or medications. If pregnant, consult physician before use.</p><p><b>Liver Sauce:</b> Take 1 tsp. by mouth. Hold in mouth for 30 seconds before swallowing. Repeat to desired dosage or as directed by a healthcare professional. Take on an empty stomach, at least 20 minutes before meals. If pregnant, consult physician before use.</p>"
;	000000000300099389	;"1 capsule per day taken with a meal and plenty of liquid."
;	000000000300087705	;"2 capsules 2 times per day or as recommended by your health care professional. Formulated to be free of allergens derived from gluten, yeast, artificial colors and flavors. Do not consume this product if you are pregnant or nursing. Consult your physician for further information. Keep container tightly closed. Store at room temperature. Keep out of reach of children. This product was sealed for your protection. Do not use if outer and/or inner neck seal is missing or damaged."
;	000000000300098988	;"Adults take 1 softgel 1-2 times a day with a meal or as directed by your qualified healthcare professional."
;	000000000300098989	;"Adults take 1 softgel a day with a meal or as directed by your qualified healthcare professional."
;	000000000300087858	;"<p>   Take up to 7 capsules with water first thing in the morning before eating. If   preferred, Qualia Mind can be taken later in the morning with food or a snack. </p> <p>   Qualia Mind is designed to be taken 5 days on and 2 days off each week. It   does not matter if the off-cycle days are consecutive or apart, so long as   they happen each week. </p>"
